  "description": "Soliton near a band edge — maximum potential depth creating a dramatic forbidden zone. Notes near the band edge resonate sharply; those in the gap are reflected. Filter envelope mimics the band structure: high resonance peak followed by sharp cutoff. The crystal that only allows certain frequencies to exist.",
